652
00:57:09.200 --> 00:57:12.251
That depends on his mother and his work.

653
00:57:13.250 --> 00:57:15.852
Surely soon. In two or three months.

654
00:57:16.128 --> 00:57:17.128
Perfect.

655
00:57:17.321 --> 00:57:18.954
To the table.

656
00:57:21.800 --> 00:57:24.055
