657
00:57:26.300 --> 00:57:27.756
He apologized.

658
00:57:29.740 --> 00:57:31.757
All is forgiven youth.

659
00:59:03.542 --> 00:59:05.251
Mi querida Anna.

660
00:59:05.459 --> 00:59:07.417
I write this letter in French,

661
00:59:07.626 --> 00:59:10.084
