665
00:59:19.834 --> 00:59:22.042
You can not imagine.

666
00:59:22.251 --> 00:59:24.459
The batallla be terrible.

667
00:59:24.667 --> 00:59:26.501
Not all sleep.

668
00:59:26.709 --> 00:59:29.626
Maybe I can get out.

669
00:59:30.001 --> 00:59:33.084
I keep in a pocket, in my heart,

670
00:59:33.292 --> 00:59:38.667
