687
01:05:14.903 --> 01:05:15.951
Anna.

688
01:05:18.370 --> 01:05:20.152
When Frantz died,

689
01:05:21.750 --> 01:05:23.253
you you held us

690
01:05:24.700 --> 01:05:26.794
