708
01:06:33.209 --> 01:06:35.584
I know that forgiveness is impossible.

709
01:06:36.084 --> 01:06:39.751
I beg you, answer me. I hope your letter, Anna. "

710
01:06:40.100 --> 01:06:41.352
"Since my return,

711
01:06:41.493 --> 01:06:43.503
I took care of my mother.

712
01:06:44.507 --> 01:06:45.804
She is better.

713
01:06:46.327 --> 01:06:50.300
I told my wonderful stay close to you,

714
01:06:51.320 --> 01:06:53.501
Frantz dear family.

715
01:06:55.511 --> 01:06:57.900
In Paris, life resumes.

716
01:06:59.027 --> 01:07:02.180
Each one tries to forget the suffering of war.

717
01:07:03.781 --> 01:07:07.520
I'm happy to be back playing with the Orchestre de Paris.

718
01:07:08.892 --> 01:07:11.080
Music soothes me ...

719
01:07:11.084 --> 01:07:13.542
Music soothes me

720
01:07:13.751 --> 01:07:15.251
and it makes me happier.

721
01:07:16.084 --> 01:07:18.584
We're a few months on tour.

722
01:07:18.792 --> 01:07:21.834
As soon as I can, I will go to see them.

723
01:07:22.042 --> 01:07:26.001
I promise to Dr. Hoffmeister back to fiddling Frantz.

724
01:07:26.584 --> 01:07:29.417
Dear friends, I hope you are well.

725
01:07:32.320 --> 01:07:35.700
I miss, like the pure air of Quedlinburg.

726
01:07:36.740 --> 01:07:37.901
See you soon,

727
01:07:38.117 --> 01:07:39.502
Adrien."

