805
01:12:54.460 --> 01:12:56.552
You can not live with doubt.

806
01:12:58.417 --> 01:12:59.453
Anna...

807
01:12:59.642 --> 01:13:01.420
You are young and beautiful,

808
01:13:01.806 --> 01:13:03.221
