01:43:33.292 --> 01:43:35.626
When did you know Fanny?

1150
01:43:36.251 --> 01:43:37.709
Since our childhood.

1151
01:43:37.917 --> 01:43:40.626
We stopped seeing each other when I went to Paris.

1152
01:43:40.834 --> 01:43:43.001
And when I returned from the front,

1153
01:43:43.209 --> 01:43:44.959
we met again.

1154
01:43:45.834 --> 01:43:47.292
She helped me a lot.

1155
01:43:49.376 --> 01:43:50.376
She too

1156
01:43:50.542 --> 01:43:52.917
He has lost family. - His brother?

1157
01:43:53.626 --> 01:43:54.626
Yes.

1158
01:43:54.667 --> 01:43:56.334
I loved his brother.

1159
01:44:04.084 --> 01:44:05.417
Sabes, Anna ...

1160
01:44:07.292 --> 01:44:09.751
She is my mother who wants this marriage.

1161
01:44:11.209 --> 01:44:12.584
It reassures.

1162
01:44:14.292 --> 01:44:15.417
Fanny, ella...

1163
01:44:15.626 --> 01:44:18.292
She has courage. I love forever.

1164
01:44:36.584 --> 01:44:37.834
Dime...

1165
01:44:38.459 --> 01:44:42.542
Would you accept to come to our wedding, in a month?

1166
01:44:43.917 --> 01:44:45.001
Fanny and I ...

1167
01:44:45.792 --> 01:44:47.292
We would be very happy.

1168
01:44:50.542 --> 01:44:51.959
I don `t believe.

1169
01:45:36.084 --> 01:45:39.381
Paris Express will leave. Close the doors, please.

1170
01:45:40.400 --> 01:45:41.400
Anna...

1171
01:45:42.626 --> 01:45:43.792
It's too late.

1172
01:45:55.001 --> 01:45:56.709
I am happy, Anna.

1173
01:46:40.250 --> 01:46:41.250
¿Hans?

1174
01:46:41.373 --> 01:46:42.373
Yes?

1175
01:46:45.784 --> 01:46:47.302
Una carta de Anna.

1176
01:46:48.552 --> 01:46:49.803
- ¿Anna? - Sí.

1177
01:47:00.400 --> 01:47:02.020
"Dear Parents

1178
01:47:02.706 --> 01:47:04.321
I am writing from Paris

1179
01:47:04.675 --> 01:47:06.922
where I finally found Adrien.

1180
01:47:08.140 --> 01:47:09.630
He's fine

1181
01:47:09.824 --> 01:47:12.524
and send them a kiss.

1182
01:47:13.195 --> 01:47:15.325
He is now the first violin

1183
01:47:15.637 --> 01:47:17.526
the Orchestre de Paris,

1184
01:47:17.908 --> 01:47:20.527
and every night I go to the opera

1185
01:47:20.625 --> 01:47:21.828
to hear it.

1186
01:47:23.101 --> 01:47:24.600
For private concerts,

1187
01:47:24.650 --> 01:47:28.050
sometimes he asks me to accompany the piano.

1188
01:47:29.153 --> 01:47:32.900
We spent wonderful moments,

1189
01:47:33.304 --> 01:47:35.401
I did go Paris

1190
01:47:35.613 --> 01:47:37.502
and all sites

1191
01:47:38.647 --> 01:47:41.003
of which Frantz had told us.

1192
01:47:42.129 --> 01:47:44.004
Yesterday at the Louvre,

1193
01:47:44.686 --> 01:47:46.995
Manet saw the box.

1194
01:47:49.125 --> 01:47:50.820
I would love to

1195
01:47:51.027 --> 01:47:52.621
you were here

1196
01:47:52.722 --> 01:47:55.202
to share these moments.

1197
01:47:56.720 --> 01:47:59.180
I do not know when to come back,

1198
01:48:00.207 --> 01:48:02.181
I am happy in Paris,

1199
01:48:03.066 --> 01:48:04.500
in the city

1200
01:48:04.904 --> 01:48:06.901
Frantz loved.

1201
01:48:07.550 --> 01:48:09.700
Beware.

1202
01:48:10.204 --> 01:48:11.542
Beware.

1203
01:48:12.800 --> 01:48:14.143
All my Love,

1204
01:48:14.200 --> 01:48:15.544
Anna."

1205
01:48:47.709 --> 01:48:49.501
Do you also love this picture?

1206
01:48:54.917 --> 01:48:55.917
Yes...

1207
01:48:57.750 --> 01:48:59.792
He made me want to live.

